                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Reminds me of old Flash games, kind of like a 'Serious Sam demake'. That may be underselling it as t is actually a lot of fun to play. The gun stacking is really neat and I like the mechanic of using defeated enemies to help with platforming. If you like what you seen then definitely worth it on a sale.",
